        "sid": "NUM 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Miriamu na Aroni walianza kumsema vibaya Mose kwa sababu ya mwanamke Mkushi aliyekuwa amemwoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasema, “Hivi kwani Mwenyezi-Mungu amezungumza kwa kumwagiza Mose peke yake? Je, hajazungumza nasi pia?” Mwenyezi-Mungu aliyasikia maneno hayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Mose alikuwa mtu mnyenyekevu kuliko watu wengine wote waliokuwa duniani.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu ghafla, Mwenyezi-Mungu akawaambia Mose, Aroni na Miriamu, “Njoni katika hema la mkutano, nyinyi watatu.” Basi, wote watatu wakaenda kwenye hema la mkutano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Mwenyezi-Mungu akashuka katika nguzo ya wingu, akasimama kwenye mlango wa hema, akawaita Aroni na Miriamu. Wote wawili wakasogea mbele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mwenyezi-Mungu akawaambia, “Sikilizeni maneno yangu: Kama kuna nabii miongoni mwenu, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu hujifahamisha kwake katika maono na kuongea naye katika ndoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ebr 3:2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini kumhusu mtumishi wangu Mose, hali ni tofauti kabisa. Yeye ana jukumu la kuwatunza watu wangu wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kut 33:11; Kumb 34:10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mimi huongea naye ana kwa ana, waziwazi na si kwa kutumia mafumbo. Yeye huliona umbo langu mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu. Kwa nini, basi, hamkuogopa kusema vibaya dhidi ya mtumishi wangu Mose?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Mwenyezi-Mungu akawaka hasira dhidi yao, akaondoka, akaenda zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wingu lilipoondoka juu ya hema la mkutano, Miriamu alionekana ana ukoma, mweupe kama theluji. Aroni alipogeuka na kumtazama Miriamu, alishangaa kuona kuwa ameshikwa na ukoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo, Aroni akamwambia Mose, “Ewe bwana wangu, usituadhibu kwa kuwa tumetenda mambo ya kipumbavu na kufanya dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usimfanye Miriamu awe kama mtu aliyezaliwa mfu, ambaye karibu nusu ya mwili wake umelika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamlilia Mwenyezi-Mungu akisema, “Nakusihi, ee Mungu, umponye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 5:2-3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Kama baba yake angemtemea mate usoni, je, hangeaibika kwa siku saba? Basi, mtoe nje ya kambi akae huko muda wa siku saba, kisha unaweza kumruhusu arudi kambini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, Miriamu akafukuzwa nje ya kambi kwa muda wa siku saba. Watu hawakuanza tena safari hadi Miriamu aliporudishwa tena kambini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya hayo, watu walifanya safari kutoka Haserothi, wakapiga kambi katika jangwa la Parani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
